## labels: quick regression nodata

## Rutile: CREATE_DISPLACEMENTS with AXES in the cell itself (supercell
## 1, the Born-charge use). Both independent atoms are on special
## positions (Ti D2h, O C2v), where phonopy's directions would give
## fewer than three; AXES displaces each by +-a, +-b, +-c instead (12
## displacements). DISTANCE in angstrom through UNITS ANG; the dataset
## records it in bohr and carries the AXES line. Then AXES with NICE and
## MINDISP: the supercell is chosen by, and reported with, the AXES
## count (12 displacements, not the 3 of phonopy's directions).
units ang
crystal library rutile
vibrations
  calculator aims
  create_displacements 1 axes distance 0.01 template 019_create_displacements_axes-*.in dataset 019_create_displacements_axes.txt
  create_displacements nice 4 mindisp axes distance 0.01 template 019_create_displacements_axes_nice-*.in dataset 019_create_displacements_axes_nice.txt
end
